  <description>
    <p>
      Coiman IDE is a code editor and IDE written in Rust. It opens folders as projects, edits
      with syntax colours and language servers, runs and debugs programs, runs tests, and works
      with Git.
    </p>
    <p>
      It has no AI features and opens no network connections of its own: it runs the tools you
      already have, such as git, compilers and debuggers.
    </p>
